{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/923fcb8ac70f3c9de75fed14e97ec0d8.avif?t=1769641549\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Memoria: Freedom is a story-driven JRPG where two very different lives intertwine, and where destiny offers the chance to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn is the determined music band leader, scarred by trauma and driven forward by necessity. She\u2019s survived by never stopping, even when there\u2019s no real choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laiza is the sheltered daughter of the continent\u2019s wealthiest family, hidden away in a mansion by her controlling father. She has every choice in the world, except the freedom to make them herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fate brings them together, their meeting sets a new path in motion. One forged in trust, resilience, and the pursuit of something more than survival: freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/4ed441a175eb05eb6bd93562254498e1.poster.avif?t=1769641549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/4ed441a175eb05eb6bd93562254498e1.webm?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/4ed441a175eb05eb6bd93562254498e1.mp4?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you help them claim it?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/7e30b7bf963efbd2f188d8aa936cf876.avif?t=1769641549\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Turn Battle System:\u00a0</strong>Decide the order of your team\u2019s actions each round. Build powerful combos and wipe out enemies in a single sweep with the strongest turn order!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/ef41457bf6d08ed233ed0b95b3849fcd.poster.avif?t=1769641549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/ef41457bf6d08ed233ed0b95b3849fcd.webm?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/ef41457bf6d08ed233ed0b95b3849fcd.mp4?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack-Type Advantage System:\u00a0</strong>Equip different weapon attack types and match them to enemy vulnerabilities. Align colors for bonus damage and unlock strategic advantages in every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orb Enhancement System:\u00a0</strong>Collect and combine Orbs earned through battle to unlock passive bonuses and upgrade character abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5d3c23c5cba9f192c1809b675e4b0781.poster.avif?t=1769641549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5d3c23c5cba9f192c1809b675e4b0781.webm?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5d3c23c5cba9f192c1809b675e4b0781.mp4?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Class System with Customizable Main &amp; Sub-Specialties:\u00a0</strong>Assign any specialty as a main or sub-role to any character. Mix and match freely to create unique tactical builds and personalized party comps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Random Encounters:\u00a0</strong>Enemies appear directly on the map, giving you the freedom to fight or avoid them at your own pace. A nod to the classics that let you explore on your terms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5870051cee0e167346e74e8de3b791a9.poster.avif?t=1769641549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5870051cee0e167346e74e8de3b791a9.webm?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/extras/5870051cee0e167346e74e8de3b791a9.mp4?t=1769641549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440010?t=1769641549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/08a3bd484587a7ec231c732adfcdd411ccc9ac55/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769641549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/76b3a3685184850f8e026dbee09787d23a674917/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769641549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440010/76b3a3685184850f8e026dbee09787d23a674917/c